patch.description:
Partial update: department transfer, manager reassignment, or a lifecycle `status`
change. `status` transitions are validated: `pending_start`→`active`; `active`↔`on_leave`;
either →`terminated` (terminal): the offboarding lesson.

get.description:
Standard `response_type=code` authorization request. Unknown `client_id` or an
unregistered `redirect_uri` fail directly (never redirected, to avoid an open redirect);
any other error redirects back with `?error=`.
